  {
    "number": 66,
    "title": "Record installed Pixoo monitoring acceptance",
    "body": "Refs #34.\n\nRecords the owner-approved Codex Desktop/Ubuntu WSL/Pixoo installation and visible turn-ended notice, the installed Hub #137 fix, actual successive-turn clearing, manual dismissal, and active-playback Monitor/Media checks. Replaces the superseded broad acceptance table and adds concise start/stop/disconnection instructions.\n\nThis changes documentation only; it introduces no product behavior or OpenSpec delta. Original source planning remains archived in PR #65. `git diff --check` passed. Independent Standards/Specification reviews and all five configured PR/main jobs remain delivery gates. The exact Desktop app version/firmware are unavailable; optical timing and excluded multi-client scenarios are not claimed.\n\nRuntime receipts are retained outside Git. The first media helper import failure and invalid early/asynchronous sample are recorded; the corrected bounded poll and real item-ID check passed. Final mode is Monitor with playback paused. No physical operation is performed by this PR.\n\nMaintained Hub guide synchronization will follow in a companion PR; public publication is separate. Do not automatically close #34 before the documentation, guide and merged-main checks are verified.\n",
    "state": "open",
